{"id":"wb-4-102","name":"孔氏南宗家庙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"孔氏南宗家庙","text":"孔氏南宗家庙（又称南宗孔庙、衢州孔庙）位于中国浙江省衢州市柯城区新桥街，是与曲阜北宗相对的孔氏南宗所建之家庙，1981年12月12日被列为浙江省文物保护单位，1996年11月20日被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E5%AD%94%E6%B0%8F%E5%8D%97%E5%AE%97%E5%AE%B6%E5%BA%99","revisionId":90844173,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=90844173","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/cf6eaf49a5bae979495e4940.jpg","title":"Kongshi_nanzong_jiamiao_9374.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Kongshi_nanzong_jiamiao_9374.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/56/Kongshi_nanzong_jiamiao_9374.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Zhangzhugang","license":"CC BY-SA 3.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0","caption":"​孔氏南宗家庙，全国重点文物保护单位，位于浙江省衢州市。","width":320,"height":213}}